   |
21 |         eat(move h.a) //~ ERROR cannot move `h.a` out of `G2`
   |                  ^^^
   = help: add a `take`-style method that returns `h.a` instead

error[E1021]: cannot move `G4 { a: mk(1), n: 2 }.a` out of `G4`, which defines a custom `drop`
